From 1fda864cca91da0aa9a87dd96e1823c3962dbd09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hhh2210 <hzy2210@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 8 Aug 2026 16:27:01 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add strict IKEv1 expandrule wire codec

Implement the five explicit ADDRULE/DELRULE wire forms against the official strongSwan 6.0.7 base while keeping dialect payload values opaque until the semantic promotion gate.

Separate lossless structural decoding from the canonical/local safety profile, clone all input-owned chunks, bound allocation and output size, and return only non-sensitive error code/offset metadata.

Add seven synthetic golden byte vectors with 28 positive and negative codec cases. The CP4A acceptance entrypoint passes the targeted libcharon suite, full make check, arm64 artifact gate, Swift tests, artifact-boundary checks, and secret scans.

Safety: offline codec only; no payload factory, IKE task, VICI, SA, route, utun, credential, or network integration.
